<title>BELGIUM: Belgium holds liquidity unchanged at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium holds liquidity unchanged at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank left unchanged money market liquidity at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date 21/05	  expiry on 28/05    NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   15.000 bln bfr    (15.000 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate		3.00 pct	   (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    93.000 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  15.94 pct</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on May 21</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on May 12</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
